1
00:00:00,555 --> 00:00:02,685
(Leonard:)Sheldon, sit.

2
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:05,272
(Sheldon:)Ah.

3
00:00:07,103 --> 00:00:10,393
(Leonard:)Well, this is nice.
We don't have a lot of company over.

4
00:00:10,565 --> 00:00:13,105
(Sheldon:)That's not true.
Koothrappali and Wolowitz come over.

5
00:00:13,276 --> 00:00:14,276
Yes, I know.

6
00:00:14,444 --> 00:00:16,904
(Sheldon:)Tuesday night we played Klingon Boggle
until 1 in the morning.

7
00:00:17,072 --> 00:00:19,572
- Yeah, I remember.
- I resent you saying we don't have company.

8
00:00:19,741 --> 00:00:22,491
- That has a negative social implication.
- I said I'm sorry.

9
00:00:23,787 --> 00:00:24,957
(Sheldon:)So...

10
00:00:25,121 --> 00:00:26,501
(Penny:)...Klingon Boggle?

11
00:00:26,665 --> 00:00:31,255
(Leonard:)Yeah. It's like regular Boggle,
but in Klingon.

12
00:00:33,713 --> 00:00:36,593
(Leonard:)That's probably enough about us.
So tell us about you.

13
00:00:37,467 --> 00:00:39,047
Me? Okay.

14
00:00:39,219 --> 00:00:42,809
I'm a Sagittarius, which probably tells you
way more than you need to know.

15
00:00:42,973 --> 00:00:46,433
(Sheldon:)Yes, it tells us that you participate
in the mass cultural delusion...

16
00:00:46,601 --> 00:00:49,641
...that the sun's position relative
to arbitrary constellations...

